            "review_title": "Review at Banh xeo Co Bong",
            "review_text": "Chris\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nThe bánh xèo restaurant is a must-try when visiting Đà Nẵng.\nJun 2023 • Family\nCô Bông's bánh xèo restaurant is a hidden gem that offers delicious and crispy pancakes filled with a flavorful combination of ingredients. The fresh herbs and tangy dipping sauce complement the dish perfectly. The friendly service adds to the overall dining experience. Cô Bông is a must-visit for bánh xèo lovers looking for an authentic taste of Vietnamese cuisine.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 3, 2023",
